   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_04"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Doing well, thank you.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.66,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_10"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My five-year-old turns bedtime into a two hour negotiation. One more story, one more water, one more hug.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.39,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Classic stalling. Try building those requests into the routine, so they're done before lights out.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 1.06,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Like, give him the water beforehand?",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 1.14,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Exactly. Water, toilet, two stories, one hug. You could even make a little picture chart so he can tick them off himself.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.99,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "He'd like being the boss of a chart.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 1.34,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "sleep.dlg9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Kids love that. Then if he asks for more, you can kindly say the chart is finished.",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 1.98,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "sleep.dlg9"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "And if he",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.04,
   "event": "distractor",
